#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:5 964a1753f4784359acf1c4b87560223c
msgid "Tuning Cruise Configuration"
msgstr "巡航配置调参"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:9 4488bdd53b7847fca9192eb1937bb1d7
msgid "Overview of Constant Altitude, Level Flight Operation"
msgstr "恒定高度平飞操作概述"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:11 61cbfa9313bc4fc58cdd3aea8ea57271
msgid ""
"\"Hands-off\" constant altitude hold cruising occurs in automatic "
"throttle modes such as FBWB, CRUISE, AUTO, GUIDED, CIRCLE, LOITER, RTL, "
"etc. See :ref:`flight-modes` for the full list of automatic throttle "
"modes."
msgstr ""
"「不干预」恒定高度保持巡航发生在自动油门模式下，如FBWB、CRUISE、AUTO、GUIDED、CIRCLE、LOITER、RTL等。参见 "
":ref:`flight-modes` 以获取自动油门模式的完整列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:13 1aedd97f096049a398aad9859b1de940
msgid ""
"In FBWB and CRUISE modes, without an airspeed sensor, the autopilot will "
"set the target throttle at :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` with the "
"throttle at mid-stick, and adjust pitch to hold altitude. The airspeed "
"will be whatever results from the change in thrust. Raising the throttle "
"stick will increase throttle and thereby airspeed."
msgstr ""
"在FBWB和CRUISE模式下，若没有空速传感器，飞控将在油门摇杆居中时将目标油门设置为 "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>`，并调整俯仰以保持高度。空速将由推力变化的结果决定。提高油门摇杆将增加油门进而增加空速。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:15 49daf5e4f7b840de884e5111994feaeb
msgid ""
"When using an airspeed sensor, the autopilot will use throttle position "
"to set the target airspeed as a linear interpolation between "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` and :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>`. "
"And pitch will be adjusted for constant altitude flight."
msgstr ""
"使用空速传感器时，飞控将使用油门摇杆位置在 :ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` （高位摇杆）和 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` （低位摇杆）之间线性插值设置目标空速，并调整俯仰以保持恒定高度飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:17 6c871c777b7541c3bee107cfd8991683
msgid ""
"In the automatic throttle controlled modes, "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` is used for the target airspeed "
"if an airspeed sensor is being used, while "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` will be set for the average throttle "
"value if no sensor is used. In AUTO and GUIDED modes, the "
":ref:`THROTTLE_NUDGE<THROTTLE_NUDGE>` option allows the pilot to tweak "
"these values while in flight with the throttle, if desired, in these "
"modes."
msgstr ""
"在自动油门控制模式下，如果使用空速传感器，:ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` "
"用于目标空速；如果不使用传感器，:ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` "
"将设置为平均油门值。在AUTO和GUIDED模式下，如果需要，:ref:`THROTTLE_NUDGE<THROTTLE_NUDGE>` "
"选项允许飞手在飞行中用油门微调这些值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:19 d601230ae65346a9b365c2725bff91bb
msgid ""
"While :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` is not used when using an "
"airspeed sensor directly, it is important to set it at a working value "
"since it will be used in case of an airspeed sensor failure."
msgstr ""
"虽然使用空速传感器时 :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` "
"不会直接使用，但将其设置为有效值非常重要，因为在空速传感器故障时将使用它。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:22 7fd946784ca14ecb961a0d7cd3e09dea
msgid "AHRS Level Attitude"
msgstr "AHRS 水平姿态"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:24 3516f6b69c9948a19cd353dcd99f247d
msgid ""
"During :ref:`common-accelerometer-calibration`, a \"level\" attitude "
"position is set with the wings and fuselage perfectly level. A plane can "
"fly holding a constant altitude at range of speeds, depending on throttle"
" level and Angle of Attack (AOA)."
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`common-accelerometer-calibration` "
"期间，会在机翼和机身完全水平的情况下设置「水平」姿态位置。飞机可以在一系列速度下保持恒定高度飞行，具体取决于油门水平和迎角（AOA）。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:28 fd5aa78fd8054ba3a33a2f0bc320e2b9
msgid ""
"The AOA is usually several degrees but varies depending on cruise "
"speed/throttle. This is the \"trim level\" pitch. This is explained in "
"the diagrams above and is known as the \"trim level\" condition. While "
"many planes will have some Angle of Incidence (i.e. the cord of the wing "
"is at a positive angle to the fuselage cord) built-in, some do not, and "
"some need a slightly higher AOA to fly at desired cruise speeds."
msgstr "AOA通常为几度，但根据巡航速度/油门而变化。这就是「配平水平」俯仰。如上图所示，这被称为「配平水平」状态。虽然许多飞机内置了一定的入射角（即机翼弦线相对于机身弦线成正角），但有些飞机没有，有些飞机需要稍大的AOA才能以所需巡航速度飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:30 79fce0c37d234aa98e28b15d619a0bf6
msgid ""
"If the level step of calibration is done with the plane's fuselage line "
"level, initial flights will be safe, but the aircraft may not hold "
"altitude at the desired flying speed in non-altitude controlled modes "
"(i.e. require too much throttle to hold altitude and/or the cruising "
"speed may be faster or slower than desired)."
msgstr "如果校准的水平步骤是在飞机机身线水平时完成的，初始飞行将是安全的，但在非高度控制模式下，飞机可能无法以所需飞行速度保持高度（即需要太多油门才能保持高度，和/或巡航速度可能比所需更快或更慢）。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:33 205af6bd577d45da81e2ad5e3accd827
msgid "Adjusting FBWB or CRUISE Mode Airspeed"
msgstr "调整FBWB或CRUISE模式空速"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:35 713ad0e615524b828cea1947ff5fd2fd
msgid ""
"The autopilot's goal in automatic throttle modes is to obtain the correct"
" combination of elevator and throttle to maintain constant altitude "
"flight. How the autopilot does this is detailed in :ref:`tecs-total-"
"energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide`."
msgstr ""
"飞控在自动油门模式下的目标是获得正确的升降舵和油门组合以维持恒定高度飞行。飞控如何实现这一目标在 :ref:`tecs-total-energy-"
"control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide` 中有详细说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:38 0f4fb704b2b4447fbb2931c5497be02a
msgid "When an Airspeed Sensor is Enabled"
msgstr "启用空速传感器时"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:40 89342c33d97040c68a6bd22e2b0c905d
msgid ""
"In FBWB or CRUISE, the target airspeed can be directly controlled with "
"the throttle stick position. Mid throttle will set the speed as halfway "
"between :ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` (high stick) and "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` (low stick)."
msgstr ""
"在FBWB或CRUISE模式下，目标空速可以直接通过油门摇杆位置控制。油门中位将设置速度为 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` （高位摇杆）和 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` （低位摇杆）之间的中间值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:42 338ea56995324dad914ab0230b6a1933
msgid ""
"The :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` parameter should be adjusted to "
"the average throttle value used at cruise speed. It optimizes the bias "
"point for the speed control loops and is used in case of airspeed "
"failure."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` "
"参数应调整为巡航速度时使用的平均油门值。它优化了速度控制回路的偏置点，并在空速故障时使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:44 e03f6515e62f46aa8e5ea0fe3e5cc7bd
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"While cruising, the artificial horizon in the OSD or GCS may show an "
"average positive or negative pitch above the level indicator (ie "
"fuselage/autopilot level). This means that the \"trim level\" pitch or "
"AOA is different than what was set during the accelerometer calibration "
"step. This can be trimmed out so that non altitude controlled modes fly "
"at the same speed and throttle. Do this by adjusting the pitch trim, "
"adding the desired degrees nose up or down using "
":ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>`. This also optimizes the speed "
"control loop bias point and will allow non altitude controlled modes to "
"fly level at the same throttle and speed. The image below is a log of a "
"vehicle flying level in CRUISE mode:"
msgstr ""
"巡航时，OSD或GCS中的人工地平线可能会显示高于水平指示器（即机身/飞控水平）的平均正或负俯仰。这意味着「配平水平」俯仰或AOA与加速度计校准步骤中设置的不同。可以通过调整俯仰配平来消除这一差异，使用"
" :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` "
"添加所需的机头上仰或下俯度数，使非高度控制模式以相同的油门和速度平飞。这也优化了速度控制回路偏置点，并允许非高度控制模式以相同的油门和速度平飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:49 53f15c5f48a04c8186a114136e85b64e
msgid ""
"Note that the altitude is constant, but at the cruising airspeed, it "
"requires -3deg pitch to maintain level flight. Therefore, the "
":ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` should be decreased by 3 degrees. "
"Note also, that the throttle is at 38%. The "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` also should be set to this value for "
"best performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:51 cd101c0a659f46e58f2ab980d3553012
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Using :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` to adjust cruise attitude will "
"also add an offset to the artificial horizon on a GCS or an OSD which "
"makes the artificial horizon reflect the trimmed pitch condition of the "
"vehicle (ie the \"level\" flight target attitude is 0 degrees).But this "
"can be disabled, if it is desired that they reflect the pitch with "
"respect the autopilots mounting plane, using the "
":ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>` bitmask bits 8 and/or 9. The "
"displayed attitude in \"level\" flight will now show the amount of "
":ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` trim pitch that has been added."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` "
"调整巡航姿态也会在GCS或OSD上的人工地平线添加偏移，但如果需要，可以使用 "
":ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>` "
"位掩码的第8位和/或第9位禁用，如果希望显示飞控在平飞时的姿态而不是平飞时调平的人工地平线。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:54 479d8316183b49e8818ab83a7150a9f2
msgid "Without an Airspeed Sensor"
msgstr "不使用空速传感器时"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:56 7170d954db45433c93b3f29ef5f7ced0
msgid ""
"Without an airspeed sensor, both the pitch trim and the "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` parameter would need to be changed "
"appropriately for the desired mid-stick cruise speed."
msgstr ""
"不使用空速传感器时，俯仰配平和 :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` "
"参数都需要根据所需的油门中位巡航速度适当调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:58 86273a6c66fa42d8b4ba24298fb6e67b
msgid ""
"Often planes need 2 or 3 degrees of pitch trim to fly at their optimum "
"cruising speed/throttle rather than at the fuselage/autopilot level "
"pitch, especially small light planes or gliders. This can be done at "
"setup by:"
msgstr "飞机通常需要2或3度的俯仰配平才能以最佳巡航速度/油门飞行，而非以机身/飞控水平俯仰飞行，小型轻型飞机或滑翔机尤为如此。可以在设置时通过以下方式完成："

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:60 70b04c43afcb4e049131f875abb342a6
msgid ""
"**(Preferred)** Add the desired degrees nose up(usually) or down to "
":ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>`."
msgstr "**(推荐)** 向 :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` 添加所需的机头上仰（通常）或下俯度数。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:61 d571e80f8cd54b98be1f86d3bf9da207
msgid ""
"Position vehicle with a few degrees nose up or down during the first, "
"Level step of accelerometer calibration to match the cruising attitude."
msgstr "在加速度计校准的第一步「水平」步骤中，将飞行器放置为几度机头上仰或下俯，以匹配巡航姿态。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:62 f86a57d0f97a4aa690b5f21a3f01aec9
msgid ""
"Position vehicle with a few degrees nose up and use the  ``Calibrate "
"Level`` button on the Mission Planner page. This adjusts the AHRS_TRIM "
"parameters. AHRS_TRIM parameters can only change the difference between "
"the autopilot's plane and \"level\" by 10 degrees maximum. If more is "
"needed, (e.g. the autopilot is mounted slightly downward), then you can "
"use :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` to alter the AOA manually."
msgstr ""
"将飞行器放置为几度机头上仰，并使用Mission Planner页面上的 ``Calibrate Level`` "
"按钮。这会调整AHRS_TRIM参数。AHRS_TRIM参数只能将飞控平面和「水平」之间的差值更改最多10度。如果需要更多（例如飞控安装略微朝下），则可以使用"
" :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` 手动调整AOA。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:64 735a847fb075444195e8ebfa8f4dd7be
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You can examine CTUN.NavPitch in the logs when at cruise speed in FBWB or"
" CRUISE to determine the average pitch trim required in these modes. "
"Appropriately adjusting :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` to lower this"
" to zero when flying level in these modes."
msgstr ""
"在FBWB或CRUISE模式以巡航速度飞行时，可以查看日志中的ATT.DesPitch来确定这些模式所需的平均俯仰配平。适当调整 "
":ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` 使在这些模式平飞时该值降至零。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-cruise.rst:66 4d6f7eba2320444d8f2295b536c3aaef
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"when using :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` to adjust trim, it will be"
" reflected in the ATT.Pitch log message, and also in the OSD and GCS "
"horizon displays (ie level horizon pitch = "
":ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` + the calibrated level pitch) so that"
" the display will be level when flying \"in trim\" even though the "
"plane's pitch is different than the autopilots calibrated pitch with the "
"vehicle level with respect to fuselage chord line."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` "
"调整配平时，它将反映在ATT.Pitch日志消息以及OSD和GCS地平线显示中（即水平地平线俯仰 = "
":ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` + "
"校准水平俯仰），这样即使飞机俯仰与飞控校准俯仰不同，「配平中」飞行时显示也将是水平的。"

